' S-519: F32 aritmetiginde ara sonuc de her adimda tek duyarliga (24 bit) yuvarlanir; AST eskiden ara sonucu double
' tutuyordu: (u + 1) - 16777216 -> AST 1, oysa 16777216 + 1 tek duyarlikta 16777216'ya yuvarlanir ve sonuc 0'dir.
DIM u AS F32 = 16777216
PRINT (u + 1) - 16777216
PRINT (u + 2) - 16777216
DIM m AS F32 = 4097
PRINT (m * m) - 16785408
DIM a AS F32 = 16777216
DIM b AS F32 = 1
DIM c AS F32 = (a + b) - a
PRINT c
DIM e AS F64 = 16777216
PRINT (e + 1) - 16777216
